DESCRIPTION:Relying solely on simple summary statistics like the mean\, med
 ian\, or standard deviation is not enough to describe complex data. Come a
 nd see why this is the case and learn what it takes to translate research 
 into an open-source library.
DTSTAMP:20261116T111146Z
LOCATION:Auditorium
SUMMARY:Data Morph: A Cautionary Tale of Summary Statistics - Stefanie Moli
 n
URL:https://pretalx.evolutio.pt/pycon-portugal-2025/talk/KWZZZS/
